--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf2d7532251303545ab78ab68b00d5cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 17F02_BlackAudioArgument
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequenceId: 17F02_BlackAudioArgument
  notes: '17F02 black-screen argument recording. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_No_Audio_Tags_Native_English.md,
    stable marker 17F02_BlackAudioArgument. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Claire
    text: Why's it off? Ben, did you shut it down?
    holdSeconds: 4.5462265
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: You told it everything. Your whole day. Then I asked how you were, and
      you told me you were fine.
    holdSeconds: 8.697169
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: You were cooking.
    holdSeconds: 2.2820754
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: I asked for ten minutes, Claire. You couldn't wait ten minutes?
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: I did wait. By the time you asked, I'd already... I'd already talked it
      through with the unit.
    holdSeconds: 7.9424524
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: I didn't have it in me to drag the whole thing back up and tell it all
      over again.
    holdSeconds: 8.319811
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: So you can tell that thing. You just can't tell me.
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: You told me to wait!
    holdSeconds: 3.0367923
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: "For ten minutes. Two weeks, Claire\u2014you've talked to it nine times.
      You've really talked to me once."
    holdSeconds: 7.565094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: I thought we told each other everything.
    holdSeconds: 3.7915094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: That doesn't mean I love you any less.
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: Then why wasn't it me?
    holdSeconds: 3.0367923
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: Because you come home wiped out every night. It's not that you don't care.
      By then, you don't have anything left.
    holdSeconds: 9.074528
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: The unit is always there. It catches me before I fall apart, so I don't
      unload all of it on you.
    holdSeconds: 9.074528
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: So talking to a machine is something you're doing for me now?
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: It didn't start that way. Lately... maybe a little.
    holdSeconds: 4.5462265
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: I didn't sign up to be replaced.
    holdSeconds: 3.7915094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: You're not being replaced.
    holdSeconds: 2.6594338
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: Then what the hell is it?
    holdSeconds: 3.414151
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Claire
    text: I don't know when it became this.
    holdSeconds: 3.7915094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Ben
    text: Yeah. Me neither.
    holdSeconds: 2.2820754
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
